1
00:00:00,280 --> 00:00:03,750
Look, I-I admit it, I may
have crossed a line here,

2
00:00:03,750 --> 00:00:07,320
(Leonard:)but come on, Raj, your
sister is a grown woman,

3
00:00:07,320 --> 00:00:10,220
and to her, I'm a forbidden
piece of white chocolate.

4
00:00:10,220 --> 00:00:12,320
(Raj:)I don't believe it.

5
00:00:12,320 --> 00:00:13,710
(Raj:)This is a terrible
betrayal of my trust.

6
00:00:13,710 --> 00:00:16,380
No, w-w-would it
help if I told you

7
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:20,330
(Leonard:)that I offered her my heart,
and she kind of stomped on it?

8
00:00:20,330 --> 00:00:23,100
(Raj:)How hard did she stomp?

9
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,100
(Leonard:)Very hard.

10
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:27,420
(Raj:)Okay, I'm good.

11
00:00:29,270 --> 00:00:31,470
(Howard:)Well, Raj,

12
00:00:31,480 --> 00:00:34,880
(Howard:)I just want to say that I'd
never betray your trust.

13
00:00:34,880 --> 00:00:37,430
(Howard:)Unlike Leonard,
I respect you.

14
00:00:37,430 --> 00:00:38,450
(Leonard:)Really?

15
00:00:38,450 --> 00:00:41,100
Mm-hmm.

16
00:00:41,100 --> 00:00:43,250
(Leonard:)Was it out of respect
that you didn't tell Raj

17
00:00:43,250 --> 00:00:45,890
(Leonard:)about the time you dropped
his iPhone in a urinal?

18
00:00:46,740 --> 00:00:50,030
Dude, I put that thing
on my face!

19
00:00:50,030 --> 00:00:52,900
(Sheldon:)I think a more amusing
violation of Raj's trust

20
00:00:52,900 --> 00:00:55,530
(Sheldon:)is when Howard convinced him
that foreigners give presents

21
00:00:55,530 --> 00:00:59,020
(Sheldon:)to Americans
on Thanksgiving.

